Description: use existing images for the menu backgrounds
 xml-height-58 referred to menuBG58, menuBGLow58, menuBGShort58,
 menuItemLong58 and menuCurrentLong58.png, and both heights to
 menuBGShort.png. None of them is in the tarball, so the menu items showed
 no background bars and text2skin logged "Couldn't load". The 58 lines
 height now uses the images of the 68 lines height, text2skin scales them
 to the item. menuBGShort (main menu without logos) uses menuBG.
Author: Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>
